  "evidence": "The settings manifest registers both page descriptors. Creators allocate and store page state and the destroyers free and clear it. The timeout picker contains localized units and static image resources; the confirm callback checks event code 7 and its action applies the chosen time or opens an additional prompt. The always-on page builds an off option and four duration options with a common callback.",
